      "text": "A catastrophe tears across the Stillness, leaving its inhabitants facing a long struggle for basic resources. For Essun, the disaster coincides with the destruction of her family: her son has been killed and her daughter is missing. She sets out to find the child while the world around her becomes increasingly hostile. The novel follows a personal search within a society shaped by fear of the earth’s destructive power.",
      "work_id": 921100030,
